      "flat": "ggml_mul_mat -> Q4_0 CPU type-trait vec_dot callback (runtime address/RVA observed in ggml-cpu.dll; source maps it to ggml_vec_dot_q4_0_q8_0 -> AVX-VNNI vpdpbusd; runtime symbol identity limited by absent export/PDB)",
